  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat",
    "Add diced onion and saute until translucent",
    "Add minced garlic and saute until fragrant",
    "Add broccoli florets and cook until tender",
    "Stir in bhuna sauce and bring to a simmer",
    "Add cooked rice, black beans, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook, covered, for 10 minutes",
    "Fluff the mixture with a fork and stir in lime juice",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot"
